{"quest_id": 7252, "name": "人の消えた村", "description": "ゴブリンによって村が占拠されたと\n報せを受けた一行。しかし、村に\n争った形跡は無く……？\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "背教の剣と信仰の騎士団", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920157, "map_no": 5884, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 47}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 15, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 88}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098240, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 76, "global_id": 75, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 97}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 180, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 180, "damage_type": "magical", "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 80, "attack_interval": 231, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098032, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 69, "global_id": 68, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 115}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "フィナン", "text": "――そろそろ、目的地の村ですね。", "face": "u1003a1"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "ああ、巡回の兵によれば、\n村はゴブリンに占領されてしまっているらしい。", "face": "u40"}, {"name": "コルム", "text": "そんな……。\n村の方々は無事なのでしょうか。", "face": "u1032a1"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "それが不思議なことに、\n村には戦闘の形跡がないそうなんだ。", "face": "u40"}, {"name": "フィナン", "text": "えぇと……？\nではゴブリンは一切争わずに\n村をまるごと手に入れてしまったと……？", "face": "u1003a1"}, {"name": "ユリアン", "text": "おいおい、それじゃあまるで、\n村人が消えてしまったみたいじゃないか。", "face": "u7"}, {"name": "コルム", "text": "何にせよ、調査してみないことには\n詳しいことはわかりませんね。", "face": "u1032a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、そろそろ村の入り口です。\n戦闘の準備と、兵への指揮をお願いします！", "face": "lf1463357272b"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャ！　テッタイ！　テッタイ！", "face": "l7060866ab643"}, {"name": "フィナン", "text": "あっ、ゴブリンが逃げていきますよ！？", "face": "u1003a1"}, {"name": "ユリアン", "text": "ちっ……森に逃げ込むつもりか。\nおい！　深追いはするなよ！", "face": "u7"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "追撃部隊はこちらで編成しましょう。\nまずは――っと、おや？\nコルムさん、どうかしましたか？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "コルム", "text": "あの、気のせいかもしれないのですが、\nこの辺りから何か、覚えのある魔力が感じられて……。", "face": "u1032a1"}, {"name": "フローガ", "text": "覚えのある魔力、ですか？\nふむ……むむ……これは……。", "face": "u878"}, {"name": "フィナン", "text": "フローガさん、何かわかりそうですか？", "face": "u1003a1"}, {"name": "フローガ", "text": "――これは、神聖騎士団の転移魔法ですね。\n以前に開かれた擬似的な門と、\n魔力のゆらぎ方が酷似しています。", "face": "u878"}, {"name": "コルム", "text": "まさか、神聖騎士団が村人をさらって……？", "face": "u1032a1"}, {"name": "フィナン", "text": "私の時のように、\n生贄に捧げるつもりなのでしょうか……。", "face": "u1003a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "急ぎ調査が必要ですね……。\n王子、まずは近くの関所へ向かいましょう。\n何か情報を掴んでいるかもしれません。", "face": "lf1463357272b"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920157_5884", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 132, "y": 258}, {"k": "m", "x": 238, "y": 424, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 177, "y": 359, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 256, "y": 176, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 199, "y": 293, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 648, "y": 268, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 330, "y": 145, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 388, "y": 171, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 449, "y": 203, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 572, "y": 250, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 573, "y": 320, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 509, "y": 342, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 376, "y": 382, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 409, "y": 431, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 483, "y": 433, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 556, "y": 435, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 630, "y": 440, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 827, "y": 293, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 706, "y": 202, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 741, "y": 286, "id": 218}, {"k": "m", "x": 705, "y": 447, "id": 219}, {"k": "m", "x": 83, "y": 418, "id": 220}, {"k": "m", "x": 224, "y": 234, "id": 221}, {"k": "m", "x": 442, "y": 363, "id": 222}, {"k": "m", "x": 306, "y": 400, "id": 223}, {"k": "m", "x": 781, "y": 461, "id": 224}, {"k": "m", "x": 780, "y": 151, "id": 225}, {"k": "m", "x": 160, "y": 425, "id": 226}, {"k": "m", "x": 508, "y": 229, "id": 227}, {"k": "r", "x": 109, "y": 348, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 268, "y": 307, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 321, "y": 337, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 619, "y": 195, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 485, "y": 285, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 815, "y": 235, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 771, "y": 350, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 58